{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37619","headline":"谷自乱离之後在西蜀半纪之余多寓止精舍与圆昉上人爲净侣昉公於长松山旧斋尝约他日访会劳生多故游宦数年曩契未谐忽闻谢世怆吟四韵以吊之 · 郑谷","name":"谷自乱离之後在西蜀半纪之余多寓止精舍与圆昉上人爲净侣昉公於长松山旧斋尝约他日访会劳生多故游宦数年曩契未谐忽闻谢世怆吟四韵以吊之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"每思闻净话，雨夜对禅牀。\n未得重相见，秋灯照影堂。\n孤云终负约，薄宦转堪伤。\n梦绕长松塔，遥焚一炷香。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37619.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37619","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}